  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut\n• the sweet potato and capsicum into bite-sized\n• chunks and place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with\n• olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to\n• coat and roast until tender, 25-30 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60b5b7e8a21e423daa2862cc/step-42d70f94.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop the brown onion. Finely chop the\n• garlic. Roughly chop the silverbeet. Drain and\n• rinse the chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60b5b7e8a21e423daa2862cc/step-1f9a3736.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil\n• over a medium-high heat. Cook the onion, stirring\n• occasionally, until softened, 4-5 minutes. Add the\n• garlic and ras el hanout and cook until fragrant,\n• 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60b5b7e8a21e423daa2862cc/step-3391ab84.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the coconut cream, diced tomatoes,\n• chickpeas, butter and the vegetable stock pot to\n• the pan and stir to combine. Bring to the boil, then\n• reduce the heat to medium-low. Simmer until the\n• stew has reduced slightly, 10-12 minutes. Add the\n• roasted veggies and silverbeet and stir through\n• until wilted, 2-3 minutes. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60b5b7e8a21e423daa2862cc/step-501fac41.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the stew is simmering, bring the water and\n• a pinch of salt to the boil in a medium saucepan.\n• Add the couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a\n• lid and remove from the heat. Set aside until all the\n• water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60b5b7e8a21e423daa2862cc/step-759b5fb2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice the long red chilli (if using). Roughly\n• chop the parsley. Divide the couscous between\n• bowls and top with the creamy chickpea stew.\n• Serve with the garlic sauce, flaked almonds,\n• parsley and chilli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60b5b7e8a21e423daa2862cc/step-d48e474b.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
